     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div>I am performing anova to test measurement invariance in a structural equation model with multiply imputed data sets. My output looks similar to this:</div><div><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">&gt;\r\nanova(fit1, fit2)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">$naive<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">   chisq       \r\ndf    pvalue <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">3.5837085\r\n4.0000000 0.4652649 <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">$lmrr<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">          \r\nF         \r\ndf1         \r\ndf2          p.F <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">   0.6882569   \r\n4.0000000 3090.2008732    0.6000262 <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">$mr<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">NULL<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">$mplus<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\">NULL</span>  </div><div><br></div><div>My questions are: </div><div>1. the p value that appears in the $naive corresponds to the corrected (scaled) p value? (this p value is the scaled difference between the naive chi square p values?) </div><div>2. Is this p value pooling the results from the imputed datasets? </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
